Package: fosos-archive-keyring
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: apt (>= 2.4)
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS archive signing key and APT source
 Installs the FosOS archive public key and a signed-by source entry for
 the stable suite. The archive signing private key is not part of this
 package.
